{"id":"gem:riquewihr","slug":"france/riquewihr","schema":"dossier_v2","place":{"name":"Riquewihr","country":"France","iso2":"FR","class":"village","lat":48.1672,"lon":7.2978,"visit_h":2.5,"categories":["village","alsace","wine","medieval","fairytale"],"designations":[{"kind":"beautiful_village","name":"Les Plus Beaux Villages de France"}]},"verdict":{"score":9,"tier":3,"label":"Worth the journey","hidden_gem":true,"confidence":"curated","components":{"beauty":0.36,"highlights":0.533,"acclaim":0.95,"appeal":0.841},"country_rank":9,"country_n":589,"country_badge":"best_of_country","country_percentile":99,"class_percentile":98},"sleep":{"beds":{"dorm":439,"private":471,"hotel2":226,"hotel3":328,"hotel4":354,"hotel5":658,"bnb_home":{"2":75,"4":91,"6":121,"8":170},"bnb_room":157},"q":"modelled"},"gallery":[{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Town_hall_of_Riquewihr_%283%29.jpg/960px-Town_hall_of_Riquewihr_%283%29.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1b/Town_hall_of_Riquewihr_%283%29.jpg/500px-Town_hall_of_Riquewihr_%283%29.jpg","caption":"Riquewihr","author":"Krzysztof Golik","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Town_hall_of_Riquewihr_(3).jpg","w":4812,"h":2772,"ok_print":true},{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Lac_Blanc_et_Rocher_Hans_depuis_le_chaos_de_pierres.jpg/960px-Lac_Blanc_et_Rocher_Hans_depuis_le_chaos_de_pierres.jpg","thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Lac_Blanc_et_Rocher_Hans_depuis_le_chaos_de_pierres.jpg/500px-Lac_Blanc_et_Rocher_Hans_depuis_le_chaos_de_pierres.jpg","caption":"Lac Blanc","author":"Tubamirum","licence":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licence_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Lac_Blanc_et_Rocher_Hans_depuis_le_chaos_de_pierres.jpg","w":2518,"h":2544,"ok_print":true}],"intro":{"lead":"Ramparts and gabled wine houses on the Alsace route, a storybook village amid vines","body":"Riquewihr is one of the most enchanting towns in Alsace. Riquewihr is a medieval city with a lot of half-timbered houses, which give the charm of the city. It is first of all a wine town surrounded by hills of vines. There are many quaint restaurants and Winstube along the main road up the hill. Good shopping in the crystal shops as well. There are old houses from the 16th and 17th centuries. Many still have wells and fountains, and their courtyards are overlooked by galleries above.","grounding":[{"source":"wikivoyage","title":"Riquewihr","url":"https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Riquewihr","licence":"CC BY-SA 4.0"}],"short":"Riquewihr is a medieval wine village in Alsace, one of Les Plus Beaux Villages de France. The lanes carry half-timbered houses, Chateau de Saint-Ulrich sits in the hills above, and four hours covers it. May to September is the season.","short_src":"rewrite","facts":{"population":1271,"visit_h":2.5}},"do":[{"name":"Cellar visit and tasting with a Riquewihr grower","type":"experience","detail":"Most cellars sit under the houses in the village, book ahead, and the local speciality is the sparkling style born here.","link":"https://www.wineroute.alsace/229002815-wine-growing-estate-chateau-de-riquewihr-dopff-irion/","evidence":{"n_sources":7,"of":21,"urls":["https://www.wineroute.alsace/229002815-wine-growing-estate-chateau-de-riquewihr-dopff-irion/","https://www.ruedesvignerons.com/en/ville/vignoble-pres-de-riquewihr","https://www.ribeauville-riquewihr.com/en/visit/wines.htm","https://best-of-upper-rhine.com/winemakers-vineyards-wine-tasting-wine-tours-alsace-kaiserstuhl/wine-tasting-in-riquewihr-preferred-winemakers/","https://i-love-riquewihr.com/wines-wineries-riquewihr-alsace-france/","https://www.winalist.com/cities/riquewihr","https://www.tripadvisor.com/Attractions-g196500-Activities-c36-t132-Riquewihr_Haut_Rhin_Grand_Est.html"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Walk the grand cru slopes above the village","type":"trail","detail":"Marked vineyard paths climb the Schoenenbourg terraces with panels on grape varieties, and carry on to the next hilltop village in half an hour.","season":[4,5,6,7,8,9,10],"link":"https://www.ribeauville-riquewihr.com/en/visit/wines.htm","evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":21,"urls":["https://www.ribeauville-riquewihr.com/LEI/Grands-Crus-wine-trail.htm","https://i-love-riquewihr.com/seasons-alsatian-wine-route-alsace/","https://www.alltrails.com/france/haut-rhin/riquewihr","https://www.komoot.com/highlight/388076","https://www.winalist.com/blog/travel-france/alsace/riquewihr-things-to-do"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Christmas market inside the ramparts","type":"festival","detail":"Chalets line the walled lanes from late November, free to walk in, with hot spiced wine and a separate row for local produce.","season":[11,12],"evidence":{"n_sources":5,"of":21,"urls":["https://www.solosophie.com/riquewihr-christmas-market/","https://www.winalist.com/blog/travel-france/alsace/riquewihr-things-to-do","https://franceadventurer.com/things-to-do-in-riquewihr-alsace/","https://travelfrancebucketlist.com/things-to-do-in-riquewihr-france/","https://www.france-justforyou.com/blog/things-to-do-riquewihr-france"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Climb the Dolder gate tower and the old defences","type":"activity","detail":"A pink sandstone watchtower of about 25 metres, with tight stairs, a small town museum and rooftops and vines from the top.","evidence":{"n_sources":4,"of":21,"urls":["https://www.odysseytraveller.com/articles/riquewihr-france/","https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Riquewihr","https://www.visitfrancetoday.com/best-things-to-do-in-riquewihr-france/g.32","https://travelfrancebucketlist.com/things-to-do-in-riquewihr-france/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Eat in a winstub","type":"experience","detail":"Wood panelled rooms serve the regional plates: thin flamed tart, slow baked meat casserole, sauerkraut with pork, all poured with white wine.","evidence":{"n_sources":3,"of":21,"urls":["https://www.odysseytraveller.com/articles/riquewihr-france/","https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki/Riquewihr","https://www.winalist.com/blog/travel-france/alsace/riquewihr-things-to-do"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Hansi museum of Alsatian illustration","type":"experience","detail":"A small collection of the artist who drew the storybook Alsace that the village itself now sells on every corner.","evidence":{"n_sources":3,"of":21,"urls":["https://travelfrancebucketlist.com/things-to-do-in-riquewihr-france/","https://www.france-justforyou.com/blog/things-to-do-riquewihr-france","https://www.visitfrancetoday.com/best-things-to-do-in-riquewihr-france/g.32"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]}],"nearby":{"lakes":[{"layer":"lakes","cc":"FR","id":"fr-lac-blanc-Q267332","name":"Lac Blanc","km":16.0,"bearing":"W","lat":48.12639,"lon":7.09111,"tier":1,"score":6.7,"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c1/Lac_Blanc_et_Rocher_Hans_depuis_le_chaos_de_pierres.jpg/500px-Lac_Blanc_et_Rocher_Hans_depuis_le_chaos_de_pierres.jpg","thumb_ok_print":true}]},"around":{"radius_km":20,"counts":{"trails":12,"cycling":10,"lakes":1},"trails":[{"cc":"FR","id":"39654","name":"Vignoble et Châteaux","km":14.7,"bearing":"S","lat":48.03489,"lon":7.28806,"tier":3,"score":8.9,"thumb":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6e/Abbaye_de_Marbach_%28Obermorschwihr%29.jpg/500px-Abbaye_de_Marbach_%28Obermorschwihr%29.jpg","km_len":11.3,"duration_min":234,"difficulty":"moderate","ascent_m":408,"descent_m":406},{"cc":"FR","id":"34969","name":"Autour du Château","km":15.0,"bearing":"N","lat":48.30106,"lon":7.3278,"tier":3,"score":8.7,"km_len":6.5,"duration_min":166,"difficulty":"easy","ascent_m":364,"descent_m":369},{"cc":"FR","id":"34930","name":"Les sites remarquables","km":15.1,"bearing":"N","lat":48.30295